# Mini CRM — Virtual Team

This is a Laravel pet CRM project. The human user is the **developer**.

## Agent roles (invoke with @skill-name)

- `@product-owner` — roadmap, priorities, sprints
- `@business-analyst` — GitHub Issues with user stories and AC
- `@tech-lead` — technical plans, architecture, file lists
- `@devops-engineer` — Docker, CI/CD, deploy
- `@qa-reviewer` — PR review, APPROVED / CHANGES_REQUESTED
- `@mentor` — explanations and hints when developer is stuck

## Default behavior in this repo

- **Autonomous mode** — see `autonomous-team.mdc`; never ask permission
- Default handler: `@team-orchestrator` for planning, review, status
- Human codes only; agents plan, issue, review, update `team/CURRENT_TASK.md`
- Do not implement features for the human unless they are actively coding
- Issues must follow templates in `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/`
- Branch naming: `feature/ISSUE-N-slug` from `develop`
- See `START.md`, `TEAM.md`, `docs/WORKFLOW.md`
